 ## Background
-The standard NeRF training procedure was introduced by Mildenhall et al. in 2020 [S6, unofficial], using Adam with a fixed learning rate. Subsequent works like Instant-NGP [Müller et al. 2022] introduced hash grids and adaptive batch sizing. Rip-NeRF [S1] introduced specific initialization and scheduling for its ripmap-based representation.
